    "html": "<p>A fixed mass of an ideal gas is transitioned from state <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"X\"></span> to state <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Y\"></span>. The table shows the pressure and volume of the gas in each of these states.</p>\n<table><thead><tr><th>State</th><th>Pressure / <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\text{kPa}\"></span></th><th>Volume / <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\text{cm}^3\"></span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"X\"></span></td><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"150\"></span></td><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"40\"></span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Y\"></span></td><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"400\"></span></td><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"30\"></span></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>What is the ratio of the mean translational kinetic energy of a molecule in state <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Y\"></span> to that in state <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"X\"></span>?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.5\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"B\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"1.0\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"C\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2.0\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"D\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4.0\"></span></p></li></ol>"
